BeanPostProcessor为Bean的后置处理器，可以在实例化对象之前或者之后，加入自己的业务逻辑。BeanPostProcessor接口的源码。
public interface BeanPostProcessor &#123;    /**    * 在对象执行Bean的init方法之前调用    **/	@Nullable	default Object postProcessBeforeInitialization(Object bean, String beanName) throws BeansException &#123;		return bean;	&#125;        /**    * 在对象执行Bean的init方法之后调用    **/	@Nullable	default Object postProcessAfterInitialization(Object bean, String beanName) throws BeansException &#123;		return bean;	&#125;&#125;

通过org.springframework.context.support.AbstractApplicationContext#getBean知道了以下场景可以使用BeanPostProcessor后置处理器（包含BeanPostProcessor子类）。我们先来看看源码，在来点实践。
直接返回代理对象而不是当前的实例。
protected Object resolveBeforeInstantiation(String beanName, RootBeanDefinition mbd) &#123;    Object bean = null;    if (!Boolean.FALSE.equals(mbd.beforeInstantiationResolved)) &#123;        // Make sure bean class is actually resolved at this point.        if (!mbd.isSynthetic() &amp;&amp; hasInstantiationAwareBeanPostProcessors()) &#123;            Class&lt;?&gt; targetType = determineTargetType(beanName, mbd);            if (targetType != null) &#123;                bean = applyBeanPostProcessorsBeforeInstantiation(targetType, beanName);                if (bean != null) &#123;                    bean = applyBeanPostProcessorsAfterInitialization(bean, beanName);                &#125;            &#125;        &#125;        mbd.beforeInstantiationResolved = (bean != null);    &#125;    return bean;&#125;protected Object applyBeanPostProcessorsBeforeInstantiation(Class&lt;?&gt; beanClass, String beanName) &#123;    for (BeanPostProcessor bp : getBeanPostProcessors()) &#123;        //若bp属于InstantiationAwareBeanPostProcessor类型        if (bp instanceof InstantiationAwareBeanPostProcessor) &#123;            InstantiationAwareBeanPostProcessor ibp = (InstantiationAwareBeanPostProcessor) bp;            Object result = ibp.postProcessBeforeInstantiation(beanClass, beanName);            if (result != null) &#123;                return result;            &#125;        &#125;    &#125;    return null;&#125;


我们只需要实现 InstantiationAwareBeanPostProcessor接口，并重写postProcessBeforeInstantiation以及postProcessAfterInitialization的两个接口方法，就可以在Spring获取Bean的时候，返回一个对象给容器，这个对象可以是一个代理对象，可以自定义切面功能。创建InstantiationAwareBeanPostProcessorTest类实现InstantiationAwareBeanPostProcessor接口，并实现postProcessBeforeInstantiation方法（我这里只实现了一个方法）。使用CGLib冬天代理，为MyBeanPostProcessorTest类生成一个代理对象，回调的类为MyMethodInterceptor。
@Component    public class InstantiationAwareBeanPostProcessorTest    implements InstantiationAwareBeanPostProcessor &#123;        @Override        public Object postProcessBeforeInstantiation(Class&lt;?&gt; beanClass, String beanName)        throws BeansException &#123;            //必须要判断，因为不止你继承了InstantiationAwareBeanPostProcessor接口            if (beanClass == MyBeanPostProcessorTest.class) &#123;                Enhancer enhancer = new Enhancer();                enhancer.setSuperclass(beanClass);                //设置回调                enhancer.setCallback(new MyMethodInterceptor());                //创建代理对象                MyBeanPostProcessorTest myMethodInterceptor = (MyBeanPostProcessorTest) enhancer                                                               .create();                return myMethodInterceptor;            &#125;            return null;        &#125;    &#125;@Component    public class MyBeanPostProcessorTest &#123;        public void myBeanPostMethod() &#123;            System.out.println(&quot;我是正主&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&quot;);        &#125;    &#125;public class MyMethodInterceptor implements MethodInterceptor &#123;    @Override    public Object intercept(Object o, Method method, Object[] objects,                            MethodProxy methodProxy) throws Throwable &#123;        System.out.println(&quot;我是正主的保护壳&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&quot;);        Object object = methodProxy.invokeSuper(o, objects);        System.out.println(&quot;我是正主的保护壳&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&quot;);        return object;    &#125;&#125;

确定实例化时使用的构造器
